|GKB============================= Shadow Illusion ============================
|GKB=|XX0   Syntax: cshadow |YKB<amount>|XX0                                             |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   Using some of the most precious metals |KKB(*cough*gold coins*cough*)|XX0    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   a bit of magic, and your shadow puppetry, you can bind a shadow to   |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   fight for you. The process will warp the gold into a shell for the   |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   illusion, allowing it to follow and fight for you.                   |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   Fifty gold pieces will sustain the shadow's shell for about a        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   minute.                                                              |GKB=
|GKB==========================================================================
